{{> header}}

<h1>Join Theme Party {{code}}</h1>

<p>On your turn you pick a theme and everyone answers one question from
it. If you picked and you're right, you get a point for every player in the game. You lose a point for
each other player who is right. On someone else's turn, being right gets you 1 point. Highest score wins.</p>

{{#error}}
  <p class="error">{{error}}</p>
{{/error}}

{{#canJoin}}
<form method="post" action="/j/{{code}}">
  <p>
    <label for="name">Your name:</label>
    <input type="text" id="name" name="name" value="{{name}}" maxlength="{{maxNameLength}}" required>
  </p>
  <p><button type="submit">Join game</button></p>
</form>
{{/canJoin}}
{{^canJoin}}
<p><a href="/">Back to home</a></p>
{{/canJoin}}

{{> footer}}
